WEBVTT

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:05.560
The target has moved.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:11.020
If you call her the target again, I'll kill you.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.130
Yes, sir.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:18.660
After all, she's my fiancee.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:57.120
"The Black Assault"

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.240
Only hard cash moves the society.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:56.530
At just the mention of a dragon, you came for us in a helicopter.

00:01:56.780 --> 00:02:02.220
Well, even among lost preciouses, dragons receive special treatment.

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:05.390
She's just as the data described!

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:07.950
No, she's even more magnificent and beautiful...

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:09.490
Data?

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:13.480
I am dragon researcher Tokura.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:18.150
This is actually the first time I've seen a real dragon.

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:22.480
Could I take a look at her dragon's mark?

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.650
Watch yourself.

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:29.550
Rose doesn't like anyone other than Ryuji.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:32.340
If you try to touch her with bad intentions, you'll get burned.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.360
You've got the wrong idea!

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:38.870
I'm only asking out of pure curiosity.

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:41.700
The red dragon's mark...

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:43.240
This must be it!

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:45.480
Hey, you're scaring Rose.

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.110
The avatar of fire.

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:52.110
The red dragon.

00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:58.990
Ryuji-kun, is this your first time here?

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.210
No, I came for my breaker examination...

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:07.260
I knew you couldn't be an ordinary human for a dragon to like you.

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:09.140
You're a breaker, are you?

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:10.550
What is your level?

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:12.300
10.

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:13.380
Level 10?

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.340
Could you be...

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.200
What's your last name?

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:17.760
It's Kisaragi.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:20.860
Are you related to the Kisaragi couple?

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:22.470
Well, yes...

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.330
The Kisaragis' son and a dragon...

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:26.750
Fascinating.

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:29.270
And I happen to be level 7.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:33.010
I'm one of a hundred professional breakers in the world.

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:36.270
I shouldn't have any trouble getting my organization approved.

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:39.340
That's not my jurisdiction...

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:42.300
Then let's talk dragons.

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:44.520
There's a lot I'd like to ask.

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:56.810
She resembles a human blonde...

00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:59.910
You wouldn't be able to tell the difference just looking at her.

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:02.970
Could I get some samples later?

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.290
I can't give you anything.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:07.760
Poke, poke, poke.

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:11.560
Her tactile responses are essentially the same.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.530
Rose, try to relax a little.

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:15.820
Excuse me.

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:21.940
Ryuji, I'm scared!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:25.090
I'm sorry, but could I get a smile?

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:27.340
I don't think that's possible...

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:28.580
Impossible.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:30.350
"Displeasure"

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.350
She's displeased.

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.120
Ice cream!

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:38.310
Ice cream is delicious!

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:39.560
Okay, okay.

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.080
Rose-chan, smile!

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:43.550
Perfect.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.440
Her oral cavity is the same as a human's as well.

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:48.850
Excuse me, doctor...

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.590
Call me by my name, Ryuji-kun.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:57.960
Tokura-san, you said this was your first time seeing a real dragon.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.910
What did you mean by that?

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.170
Exactly what I said.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:08.470
90% of dragon research comes from the notes of a man found ten years ago.

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:10.060
Notes?

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:14.550
The society classified them top secret when it acquired them...

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:17.470
so only a few people know about its existence.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:23.370
He found a dragon's egg and raised the hatchling.

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.900
Dragons are born from eggs?

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:27.290
Yes.

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:33.910
According to his notes, he discovered the large egg in some rocks in Europe.

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:37.920
The day after he took it home, a beautiful young girl hatched from the egg.

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:42.660
She was 13 or 14, about the same as Rose.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:44.940
I'm done!

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:51.330
They're probably born partially matured so they can move as soon as they hatch.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:54.920
It's unknown why they take on the form of humans...

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:59.950
but once they're fully grown, they can take on a dragon form.

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:02.390
So Rose can transform, too?

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:05.120
She's still just a whelp.

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:07.930
The most she can do is sprout wings from her back.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:08.950
Wings from her back?

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.650
She doesn't have any?

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:12.780
I'm not sure.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.090
When I put her in the bath yesterday, she...

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:17.420
I can't remember!

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:19.120
Ryuji-kun, take a look!

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:21.250
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:23.230
She'll throw a fit if it's not you!

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.690
Please!

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:29.350
I'll check from over her clothes.

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:30.790
That's what you want, isn't it?

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.750
Please do!

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:37.350
I'm going to touch your back.

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:38.480
Touch?

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:04.110
What do you think?

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:07.880
I thought I felt something around her scapula.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:09.800
I'm not too sure.

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:13.900
Could she still be growing?

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:15.960
Ryuji-kun, what's wrong?

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:21.360
Eriko-san, I think I may have met Rose before.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:25.480
The notes are from Albania, aren't they?

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:26.410
Yes.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:27.820
How did you know?

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:32.630
My parents took me there ten years ago.

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.370
They probably went with the intention of finding a dragon.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.720
I got separated from my parents.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:42.010
When I was lost in among some rocks, I saw Rose hatch from an egg...

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:44.410
Ryuji.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.330
I lost consciousness after that.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:52.480
I can't remember how I got home.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.490
To be honest, I had thought it was a dream until now.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:59.010
Who wouldn't be surprised to see a human hatch from an egg?

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:00.780
Well, she is a dragon.

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:07.140
Dragons normally live inside a barrier undetectable by humans.

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:12.150
If Ryuji-kun stumbled into it, this is a major discovery!

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:16.300
Rose-chan, did someone take you out of there?

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:19.110
I left myself.

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:20.270
Then I got caught.

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:22.470
By Fang, maybe?

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:26.880
They must have found the barrier and kept watch over it.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:28.880
Why did you leave?

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:30.420
Because I wanted to see Ryuji.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:32.600
Fascinating.

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:37.650
This may be proof dragons are imprinting creatures.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:38.920
Imprinting?

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:42.880
Is that thinking the first thing they see after they hatch is their parent?

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:46.470
Yes, it's commonly known as "surikomi."

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:52.740
It's the perfect explanation for a proud and aggressive dragon liking a human.

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:59.090
Therefore, acquiring a dragon's egg would allow one to create an obedient dragon.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:00.820
This is a major discovery!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.740
Amazing! This is amazing!

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:11.710
What good does it do us if she's a real dragon?

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.460
I don't know...

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:17.500
but everyone's got a weakness.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:22.710
Ryuji.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:27.720
"Imprinting!"

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:30.000
Please call me back.

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:35.360
Well? What's going to happen to Rose now?

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:37.730
I'm planning on additional questioning...

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:41.820
and testing on her cell samples.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:46.140
Ryuji-kun's presence will help things proceed efficiently.

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.300
I don't know about that.

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:51.340
He may be a little hurt.

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:55.980
He's an interesting person as well.

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:59.450
There are only seven level 10 breakers in the world.

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:03.600
But despite that, he's what you might call extraordinarily normal.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:07.340
Ryuji-kun is the same as Rose.

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:09.150
They're both still growing.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.320
That's bitter.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:26.130
Ryuji-kun's not here today.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:29.730
Did you make it to his house yesterday?

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:30.840
I did.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:33.510
What about that beauty? Was she with him?

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.030
Yeah...

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:37.800
With an older woman?

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.820
A beautiful childhood friend?

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:41.650
At his apartment together?

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:44.120
What is this summer affair?

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:48.400
Will Ryuji have lost the eyes of a youth when the summer's over?

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:50.100
Traitor!

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:52.080
It's not like that.

00:10:57.560 --> 00:11:00.640
I'd never expect Ryuji-kun to do that.

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:03.000
I am worried he's absent, though.

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.340
Have you tried calling him?

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:09.260
I don't know his phone number.

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:10.860
Shall I call him?

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:13.340
How do you know his number?

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.260
He gave it to me when I asked.

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:16.870
Why did you ask?

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:18.640
Why not?

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:28.560
He's not answering.

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:30.360
Maybe he's not home.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.550
Who was that girl?

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:41.390
Does this belong to her?

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:44.460
She already had it when we rescued her.

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:46.700
It looks like a Lost Precious.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.780
That would be more natural.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:54.990
Dragons have a habit of collecting treasure.

00:11:54.990 --> 00:12:00.410
You mean the place Rose is from could be full of Lost Preciouses?

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:05.100
Yes. The two seem to have some kind of sensitivity to...

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:06.780
Excuse me!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:10.070
This is top secret, so don't tell anyone!

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:12.650
Who'd be fool enough to tell anyone?

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:14.920
Ryuji, you look down.

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:16.620
That's not true.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:19.020
Really?

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:20.720
Really.

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:25.980
She really likes you. I'm jealous.

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:28.040
To be honest, I'm not sure about this.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.140
I don't want to get too involved with lost preciouses.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.710
What are you saying?

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:35.380
Lost Preciouses have unlimited potential!

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.710
They're the wings that will free humanity from reality!

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:43.250
Acquiring them will free us from our every day lives!

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:45.290
Lost Preciouses are romance!

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:51.220
Hello?

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:54.690
It's been a while.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.190
I'll hand the phone to Ryuji-kun.

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:58.570
Here.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.090
It's your mother.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.220
Why?

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.280
I called her.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:11.800
Hello?

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:14.620
Is there really a dragon girl there?

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.520
Mom, calm down.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.370
I'll get a ticket back to Japan right away!

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:21.120
Don't hand it over to the society!

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:24.040
They'll never let it go!

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.690
She hasn't changed.

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:31.090
We haven't spoken in a year, and this is what I get.

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:33.810
Her head's full of nothing but Lost Preciouses.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.350
Ryuji, are you lonely?

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:39.030
I'm not lonely.

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.830
She's been this way since I was little.

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:43.700
Are you lonely?

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.170
I told you, I'm not.

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:49.130
My parents have never been there for me.

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:50.490
Ryuji...

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:55.530
Stop manipulating people with your imprinting!

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:58.990
I'm sick of Lost Preciouses!

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:01.650
Leave me alone.

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:13.210
Eriko-san, Tokura-san, I'm going home.

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:29.200
I'll go take a look.

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.400
Will you be all right by yourself?

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:33.310
We will provide you with support.

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:37.020
Who do you think you're talking to, Kai?

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:43.580
I'm having them prepare a car for you.

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:45.300
Do you mind waiting a bit?

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:46.910
Okay.

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:50.710
Ryuji.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:01.750
Ryuji-kun, say something to Rose.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.840
This may be the last time you see her.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:07.620
But I'm not going to help...

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:11.160
The society was hiding the existence of the notes.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:13.790
There's no way they'd announce they have a real dragon.

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:19.320
Members of Fang will come for her, and she'll be under heavy guard.

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:20.910
That's awful.

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:23.220
Eriko-san, you're going to let this happen?

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:29.040
I called them with the intention of having them take her in.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.600
But more importantly...

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:32.210
Come on.

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:53.130
Rose?

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:56.780
Please leave.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:57.980
This is private property.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:15:59.860
Unauthorized entry is...

00:16:01.820 --> 00:16:04.830
Kai, prepare a car for when we leave.

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:09.300
I've come to save you, red dragon princess.

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:15.640
Damn it!

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:25.200
Fire!

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:47.280
Intruder alert! Intruder alert!

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:50.720
All units meet in the hallway in uniform.

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:53.900
The intruder is a single unarmed male.

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:55.710
A young man?

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:59.000
Stay where you are.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.950
Switching to panic room mode.

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:02.240
Understood.

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:08.520
We'll be safe even if there's an explosion outside.

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:22.460
Visual confirmation of the target!

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.900
He really is just a young man.

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:28.780
If you call me your target again...

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:30.840
I'll kill you.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:32.430
Fire!

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:39.660
I said I'd kill you.

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:44.190
Masks on!

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:52.040
Ineffective.

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:22.070
Is it over?

00:18:36.270 --> 00:18:37.640
Let's see...

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:39.200
This is it, isn't it?

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:46.090
There she is.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:50.080
No need to hide, princess.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.460
I'm here to rescue you.

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:55.040
Who are you?

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:57.400
I'm Onyx.

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:59.800
I'm the princess' fiancee...

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:01.710
and a black dragon.

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:05.100
That necklace is the mark of our engagement.

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:09.930
I don't know Onyx.

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:11.930
What's going on?

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:15.560
We've received retrospective approval.

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:18.000
You're Rose, are you?

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:20.110
Not a bad name.

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:23.850
Move.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:31.710
Ryuji!

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:33.190
Ryuji-kun!

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:34.370
Did that hurt?

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:36.200
Sorry, kid.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:41.440
Ryuji, Ryuji!

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:47.350
I am Kisaragi Ryuji.

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:49.100
So what?

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:53.740
Have you ever wondered what a crawling bug's name is?

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:56.210
I am not an insect.

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:59.230
It's the same thing from our point of view.

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:03.040
Let's go, princess.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.240
There's nothing to worry about.

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:12.620
Let go of her.

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:18.360
Ryuji!

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:24.210
The only reason I won't kill is you is because the princess is here.

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:26.970
That earring!

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:29.640
That's my Lost Precious!

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:30.960
Oh, really?

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:34.540
I took it from some mansion about ten years ago.

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:36.630
You're Fang, aren't you?

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:39.390
Give it back! That belongs to my collection!

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:48.770
Eriko-san.

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:50.500
She's just unconscious.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.380
I'm kind to women...

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:56.780
...and ruthless to men.

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:00.610
Rose...

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:14.050
I knew you'd understand, princess.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:21.780
Rose...

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:33.450
Rose...

00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:39.730
Rose!

00:23:24.940 --> 00:23:39.820
Next Episode "Contract of Determination"

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:28.390
Yes, this is Kisaragi of the top floor.

00:23:28.390 --> 00:23:30.860
No, she's my cousin. She'll be leaving soon.

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:33.000
No pets allowed? Yes, I understand.

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:34.540
I don't have a cat!

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:35.560
A dog? No.

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:36.800
A monkey? No.

00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:37.770
She's a dragon...

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:39.660
I'm sorry. The truth is...
